  {%- comment -%} =================== BROCHURE CTA (after reseller section) =================== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="zn-brochure">
    <div class="zn-wrap zn-reveal-js">
      <p class="zn-eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold-soft)">Grow With Us</p>
      <h3>Want to bring Zyzven Naturals to your community?</h3>
      <p>Whether you are an independent entrepreneur, retailer, wellness professional or distributor, explore the opportunities to grow with us.</p>
      <a class="zn-btn zn-btn--gold" href="{{ section.settings.url_brochure | default: '#' }}">
        View Retail &amp; Partner Brochure <span class="zn-btn__arrow">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} =================== PULL QUOTE BAND 2 (pre-finale) =================== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="zn-band">
    <div class="zn-wrap"><q>We are no longer trying to prove that Zyzven Naturals can work. <em>We are preparing to scale what we have already proved can work.</em></q></div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} =================== FINALE (always open) =================== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="zn-finale">
    <div class="zn-wrap zn-narrow zn-reveal-js">
      <div class="zn-finale__kicker">
        <p class="zn-eyebrow">Now We Scale</p>
        <h2>Ready for the next chapter</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="zn-body">
        <p>The story of Zyzven Naturals has never been perfectly linear. We have gone from a small ethnic shop in Sweden to products made in a kitchen in Jamaica; from hair oil to medicinal teas; from Facebook Lives to conversations about hormones, fertility and menopause that brought thousands of people into our community; from handmade products to professional manufacturing; from building momentum to having to start over in another country. And then we rebuilt.</p>
        <p>That matters because Zyzven Naturals today is not simply an idea with potential. It is a brand that has been tested by customers, by relocation, by changing markets and by the realities of building a company from the ground up. Our customer base has largely been built organically rather than through paid advertising. Our products have travelled because people talked about them.</p>
        <p>At the same time, we have spent years strengthening what sits behind that demand: formulations, testing, manufacturing relationships, international fulfilment, brand protection and a more professional retail and distribution structure. We now warehouse across the USA, UK, Canada, Sweden and Jamaica, while continuing to develop our international reach.</p>
        <p>Our goal now is to place Zyzven Naturals in more communities, more retail environments and more international markets while protecting the trust that built the company in the first place. We want customers to feel confident buying it, entrepreneurs and retailers to see a range they are proud to carry, distributors to see an established story and proven formulations, and strategic partners to see a founder-led company with authentic origins, organic demand, international ambition, established infrastructure and considerable room still to grow.</p>
        <p>Zyzven Naturals began because I needed answers. It grew because other people recognised themselves in the questions. It survived because Lawrence and I were willing to rebuild it when life changed. And it continues because our customers kept believing in what we were creating strongly enough to tell someone else.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="zn-fig">
        {%- if section.settings.img_final != blank -%}
          <img src="{{ section.settings.img_final | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="The Zyzven Naturals product range" loading="lazy" width="1600">
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="zn-ph zn-ph--tall"><span class="zn-ph__leaf">&#10047;</span><span class="zn-ph__tag">image_final</span><span class="zn-ph__label">Strong modern group shot of the full Zyzven Naturals range.</span></div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </figure>
      <p class="zn-manifesto">Rooted in heritage. Refined by knowledge. Formulated with purpose. Built for legacy.</p>
      <div class="zn-wordmark">Zyzven Naturals</div>
      <p class="zn-tagline">From our family to yours &mdash; and from St. Thomas, Jamaica, to the world.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} =================== FINAL CTA GRID =================== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="zn-cta">
    <div class="zn-wrap">
      <div class="zn-cta__head zn-reveal-js">
        <p class="zn-eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold-soft)">Where to Next</p>
        <h3>Four ways to move forward with us</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="zn-cta-grid zn-reveal-js">
        <a class="zn-card" href="{{ section.settings.url_shop | default: '/collections/all' }}">
          <span class="zn-card__num">01</span>
          <h4>Shop Our Products</h4>
          <p>Explore the Zyzven Naturals wellness collection.</p>
          <span class="zn-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="zn-card" href="{{ section.settings.url_retailer | default: section.settings.url_brochure | default: '#' }}">
          <span class="zn-card__num">02</span>
          <h4>Become a Retailer or Reseller</h4>
          <p>Carry the range in your shop, clinic, salon or community.</p>
          <span class="zn-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="zn-card" href="{{ section.settings.url_wholesale | default: '#' }}">
          <span class="zn-card__num">03</span>
          <h4>Wholesale &amp; Distribution</h4>
          <p>For established commercial partners and volume orders.</p>
          <span class="zn-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="zn-card" href="{{ section.settings.url_partnership | default: '#' }}">
          <span class="zn-card__num">04</span>
          <h4>Strategic Partnerships</h4>
          <p>For market expansion, investment interest and aligned strategic relationships.</p>
          <span class="zn-card__arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var root = document.getElementById('zn-{{ section.id }}');
  if(!root) return;

  /* Chapter index -> open target chapter + smooth scroll */
  root.querySelectorAll('.zn-index button').forEach(function(btn){
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var t = root.querySelector('#'+btn.getAttribute('data-target'));
      if(!t) return;
      t.open = true;
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches;
      t.scrollIntoView({behavior: reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block:'center'});
    });
  });

  /* Scroll reveal */
  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches;
  var items = root.querySelectorAll('.zn-reveal-js');
  if(reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)){
    items.forEach(function(el){ el.classList.add('zn-in'); });
  } else {
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
      entries.forEach(function(e){
        if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('zn-in'); io.unobserve(e.target); }
      });
    }, {threshold:0.12, rootMargin:'0px 0px -8% 0px'});
    items.forEach(function(el){ io.observe(el); });
  }
})();
</script>

